TOKEN_ID: company-agent-learning-protocol-v1
STATUS: PENDING_APPROVAL
PROTOCOL: config/think/protocol.json

LOOP:
  recall relevant memory -> declare preconditions -> execute bounded job ->
  collect evidence -> receive reviewer or quality signal -> mint structured
  THINK token -> feed DTHINK -> update agent memory -> create bounded follow-up

REQUIRED_EVIDENCE:
  task id, agent id, memory id, authority boundary, changed files, commands,
  results, independent quality signal, confidence, limitations, follow-up

SAFETY:
  no secrets in THINK or DTHINK; no autonomous production or destructive
  changes; no unverified self-modification; incomplete evidence stops promotion

PROMOTION:
  Keep tokens PENDING_APPROVAL until current evidence, independent review, and
  any required human approval are recorded.
